STATEMENT: >>>
Every document in the canon, one card each: a document is a tree of narratives whose root nothing contains, and it appears here by being written. A document is no longer a tab of its own ([LINK: DEC-TABS-ARE-A-DECLARED-VOCABULARY]) -- its own screens open from Start, under the system that holds it, and its tab narratives join the tabs they name.
<<<
